---
import Diagram from './Diagram.astro';
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/agents-fanout-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/agents-fanout-dark.svg?raw';
---

<Diagram
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  maxWidth={560}
  caption="One message fans out to an agent per candidate, each running in the background. The pages fan back in to a single recap."
>
  For each of sixty-four candidates, one Claude Code agent launches from a
  single message, each running in the background. Every agent writes a
  structured research page. The pages converge into one recap with verdicts.
</Diagram>
